    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81392" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί-θετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιθετός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτίθημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put round</i> or <i>to be put round</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πρόσωπον</span> a <i>mask</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristomen.
